NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE.

This is a research artifact, and its headline result is negative. The scorer
clears Solana liquidity pools of hard-rug risk on the population it was
trained on; it does not identify safe pools, it is not a rug alarm, and it
does not select assets that appreciate. On the one outcome study run against
it (Stage E, 2026-08-14), every cleared pool in a birth-ordered launch cohort
went to zero. Read README.md and FINDINGS.md before using any output from this
software to make a financial decision — the warranty disclaimer above applies
with particular force to that use.
